# Gait changes in the real game, frame by frame (the Motion Studio, phase 2, step 3, 2026-11-25; CLAUDE.md's hard rule:
# every movement change filmed in the real game, frozen and stepped, from three sides): a lioness, then a grown buffalo,
# sent down a long flat strip at a walk, a trot, a gallop (the buffalo's charge), a trot and a walk again (the paces their
# own goals use), stepped a tick a picture from its side, three quarters ahead and the front, each body recorded. Each
# gait change should come at its plan's moment (gaits.<old>.change.<new>), its legs easing a short way into the new clip.
# Two scenes, so each walker's recording (body.jsonl.gz) has its own folder. The strip lies round the middle: Minecraft's
# ground navigation finds no route to a goal in a chunk not loaded (the first try sent them to x 84: they never moved);
# each "go" plans afresh from where the walker is (a route reaches 16 blocks or so; the whole run is about 22).
#   ./gradlew runFilm -PfilmScene=tools/film/gait_changes.film   pictures in run-film/screenshots/gait_lioness/, gait_buffalo/
#   python tools/pace_report.py run-film/screenshots/gait_lioness run-film/screenshots/gait_buffalo
scene gait_lioness
cmd time set noon
cmd weather clear
lens 50
cmd fill -30 -61 -7 30 -50 7 minecraft:air
cmd fill -30 -63 -7 30 -63 7 minecraft:dirt
cmd fill -30 -62 -7 30 -62 7 minecraft:grass_block
wait 20
walker antcolonies:lioness -20.5 -61 0.5 -90
aim film-walker
cam side 0 1.2 -7
cam three 5 2.5 -5
cam front 7 1.2 0
record on 1 all
go 16 -61 0 0.83
burst lioness_walk 40 1
go 16 -61 0 1.27
burst lioness_trot 30 1
go 16 -61 0 2.08
burst lioness_gallop 30 1
go 16 -61 0 1.27
burst lioness_back_trot 30 1
go 16 -61 0 0.83
burst lioness_back_walk 40 1
record off
cam off
scene gait_buffalo
cmd time set noon
cmd weather clear
lens 50
cmd fill -30 -61 -7 30 -50 7 minecraft:air
cmd fill -30 -63 -7 30 -63 7 minecraft:dirt
cmd fill -30 -62 -7 30 -62 7 minecraft:grass_block
wait 20
walker antcolonies:buffalo -20.5 -61 0.5 -90 OwnSize:1.0f,Led:1b
aim film-walker
cam side 0 1.5 -9
cam three 6 3 -6
cam front 9 1.5 0
record on 1 all
go 16 -61 0 0.76
burst buffalo_walk 40 1
go 16 -61 0 0.96
burst buffalo_trot 30 1
go 16 -61 0 1.70
burst buffalo_charge 30 1
go 16 -61 0 0.96
burst buffalo_back_trot 30 1
go 16 -61 0 0.76
burst buffalo_back_walk 40 1
record off
cam off
cmd tick unfreeze
